# [[.Name]]

Go service generated by `omni new service [[.Name]] --lang go`.

| Endpoint | Purpose |
| --- | --- |
| `GET /healthz` | liveness |
| `GET /readyz` | readiness; returns 503 while starting and while draining on SIGTERM |
| `GET /metrics` | Prometheus counters |
| `GET /v1/info` | service name and build version |

```bash
make test      # go test -race
make run       # listens on :[[.Port]] (override with PORT)
make check     # omni check: vet, gofmt, govulncheck, secrets, Dockerfile, Kubernetes rules
```

The image is distroless and runs as a non-root user. `deploy/k8s.yaml` sets a
read-only root filesystem, drops all capabilities, and sets resource limits and probes.
